Package: rafe
Type: Package
Title: Decision-Aligned Forecast Evaluation and Moment Correction
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sebastian", "Stöckl", email = "sebastian.stoeckl@uni.li",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tobias", "Salcher", role = "aut"),
    person("Michael", "Hanke", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Computes risk-adjusted forecast errors (RAFE), covariance
    forecast errors (C-RAFE), and the combined upper bound on the Sharpe-
    ratio gap (T-RAFE) of plug-in mean-variance portfolios, as introduced
    in Salcher, Stoeckl & Hanke (2026, Journal of Forecasting). Also
    provides decision-aligned moment-correction estimators (Stein-style
    mean shrinkage in the risk-whitened space and eigenvalue-floor
    covariance cleaning) and training-loss objectives for XGBoost and
    torch, as developed in the RAFE Program of papers.
